happened and just disappeared on her.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.099
I think he even walked out on
her in the middle of the night.

00:15:02.489 --> 00:15:06.530
Um, and never messaged her again, and
that kind of stuff was like, for a while

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:10.130
