relationships in Germany and in my,

00:16:07.155 --> 00:16:09.135
like in your twenties, in my bubble.

00:16:09.255 --> 00:16:12.645
It's very normal and common to
be in a long-term relationship.

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:14.750
In that, at that age in Germany.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.820
And it doesn't necessarily
mean that you're trapped.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:22.250
Whereas I feel like a lot of American
guys this age or girls too, um, have

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.890
