00:17:16.525 --> 00:17:20.879
And I feel like relationships in that
sense are a little bit more mature

00:17:20.879 --> 00:17:22.770
in Germany, even from a young age.

00:17:23.189 --> 00:17:26.729
Um, 'cause I, I moved in with my
